Error [jet.NondeterminismInPureEval]: `time.today` is non-deterministic and cannot appear in a pure evaluation.
  --> Tests/UI/Determinism/nondeterministic_time_classification_is_shared_by_purity_and_folding.jet:3:44
    |
  3 | pure_today: fn() -[]> String { return date.today().to_string() }
    |                                            ^^^^^
 Why: Pure evaluation must produce the same result on every machine.
 Fix: Remove this call, or remove the enclosing function's explicit empty effect bound.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E3403
